from customized digitization.

00:00:31.460 --> 00:00:35.240
The desire to digitize is
often stopped before it begins

00:00:35.240 --> 00:00:37.160
due to lack of resources.

00:00:37.160 --> 00:00:39.650
To take it a step
further, it's even harder

00:00:39.650 --> 00:00:42.920
