smarter and more impactful.

00:00:46.830 --> 00:00:49.130
But AI can be expensive.

00:00:49.130 --> 00:00:51.620
Between overhead,
sourcing rare talent,

00:00:51.620 --> 00:00:54.140
and implementing a
new infrastructure,

00:00:54.140 --> 00:00:56.630
finding a solution that
meets all the needs

00:00:56.630 --> 00:00:59.640
