can be challenging.

00:00:59.640 --> 00:01:01.940
So how do you find
a solution that

00:01:01.940 --> 00:01:04.550
can help drive
digital transformation

00:01:04.550 --> 00:01:07.160
with the goodness of AI?

00:01:07.160 --> 00:01:09.860
Google Cloud's no-code
platform AppSheet

00:01:09.860 --> 00:01:13.190
is an intelligent platform
that enables anyone

00:01:13.190 --> 00:01:16.670
to be both an app
creator and an AI expert,

00:01:16.670 --> 00:01:18.710
no matter their background.

00:01:18.710 --> 00:01:20.420
What makes this possible?

00:01:20.420 --> 00:01:24.380
A combination of baked-in
machine learning and Google's

00:01:24.380 --> 00:01:26.370
AI in action.

00:01:26.370 --> 00:01:29.810
These allow app creators to
simplify the app creation

00:01:29.810 --> 00:01:33.500
process by interpreting user's
intent with the AppSheet

00:01:33.500 --> 00:01:37.550
Editor, make their app more
powerful and efficient,

00:01:37.550 --> 00:01:41.030
engage with your data
and users in new ways.

00:01:41.030 --> 00:01:43.550
What does this
look like exactly?

00:01:43.550 --> 00:01:46.340
Smart Assistant behaves
like Google Assistant

00:01:46.340 --> 00:01:50.240
inside your app and customized
to your business domain.

00:01:50.240 --> 00:01:53.000
Using natural language,
it searches your data

00:01:53.000 --> 00:01:55.580
based on how the
model is trained.

00:01:55.580 --> 00:01:58.160
Can you show me inspections
from last month?

00:02:03.100 --> 00:02:07.090
Another AI capability is
Optical Character Recognition,

00:02:07.090 --> 00:02:11.620
known as OCR, which
extracts data from images.

00:02:11.620 --> 00:02:13.190
Here's an example of that.

00:02:13.190 --> 00:02:17.110
In this inspection app, we've
already done some pre-work

00:02:17.110 --> 00:02:20.140
by training our data
model to identify

00:02:20.140 --> 00:02:22.490
what we should be extracting.

00:02:22.490 --> 00:02:26.140
We'll start a new entry by
clicking on New Inspection,

00:02:26.140 --> 00:02:29.170
and can now add a new
image to this form.

00:02:29.170 --> 00:02:31.570
We'll upload a new
image to the app,

00:02:31.570 --> 00:02:35.320
and we can now see that the form
has been automatically filled

00:02:35.320 --> 00:02:36.700
with the data from the image.

00:02:41.200 --> 00:02:43.540
The takeaway from
all this is that you

00:02:43.540 --> 00:02:46.540
